P1F-Census -- authors

Andrei V. Ivanov     ORCID 0000-0002-1574-6716
Leonid M. Tertitski  ORCID 0009-0002-7556-9552

Both are authors of the work this repository publishes. The search engine under
source/ is joint work by the two of them, developed before this repository was
made public; the run scripts, the regression suite and the catalogues under
AllResults/ come from that same work.

Authorship of record is CITATION.cff, together with the creator list of each
Zenodo dataset the catalogues mirror -- the dataset DOIs are in the README.
Those are the lists to cite. Git commit metadata records who committed a
change, which is a different question and not a statement of authorship.

Leonid M. Tertitski is the corresponding author, reachable through the ORCID
record above.
